ec6aee3e16f27480d8d85d3a344187e.png)\n\nThe region $D$ is the quarter-circle shown above. What is $$\n\\displaystyle \\iint_D \\left(x^{2} - y^{2}\\right) \\sqrt{x^{2} + y^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}A\n$$ expressed in polar coordinates?\n\nChoose a change-of-variables setup with $r\\geq0$ that describes $D$ and the transformed integrand, including the Jacobian."] [:db/cas 17592186535330 :question/problem "![](images/7b/7bd61d778e3ea17a10adad21dd63cfae068af48700e6217194bb48e995c9f6e7.png)\n\nThe region $D$ is the circle shown above. What is ${∬}_{D}({x}^{2}-{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}A$ expressed in polar coordinates?\n\nChoose a change-of-variables setup with $r\\geq0$ that describes $D$ and the transformed integrand, including the Jacobian." "![](images/7b/7bd61d778e3ea17a10adad21dd63cfae068af48700e6217194bb48e995c9f6e7.png)\n\nThe region $D$ is the circle shown above. What is $$\n\\displaystyle {∬}_{D}({x}^{2}-{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}A\n$$ expressed in polar coordinates?\n\nChoose a change-of-variables setup with $r\\geq0$ that describes $D$ and the transformed integrand, including the Jacobian."] [:db/cas 17592186535332 :question/problem "![](images/66/66c8e80f89c7964cae5443f9e3cb04916ec6aee3e16f27480d8d85d3a344187e.png)\n\nThe region $D$ is the quarter-circle shown above. What is $\\iint_D 2 x y \\sqrt{x^{2} + y^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}A$ expressed in polar coordinates?\n\nChoose a change-of-variables setup with $r\\geq0$ that describes $D$ and the transformed integrand, including the Jacobian." "![](images/66/66c8e80f89c7964cae5443f9e3cb04916ec6aee3e16f27480d8d85d3a344187e.png)\n\nThe region $D$ is the quarter-circle shown above. What is $$\n\\displaystyle \\iint_D 2 x y \\sqrt{x^{2} + y^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}A\n$$ expressed in polar coordinates?\n\nChoose a change-of-variables setup with $r\\geq0$ that describes $D$ and the transformed integrand, including the Jacobian."] [:db/cas 17592186535337 :question/problem "![](images/b4/b4a332a1bea58e47ab58fa47c6944213ce4caa5d26e6bfb129fea613adcd52